flowchart TD
  U[Web / mobile client] -- SSE stream --> API[Assistant API<br/>auth · session · history]
  API --> ORC[Orchestrator<br/>prompt templates · RAG · tools]
  ORC --> RET[(Retrieval<br/>vector + keyword)]
  ORC --> GW[LLM gateway<br/>budgets · routing · fallback · cache · redaction]
  GW --> P1[Provider A<br/>large model]
  GW --> P2[Provider B<br/>fallback]
  GW --> SH[Self-hosted small model<br/>vLLM on GPUs]
  GW --> C[(Response cache)]
  GW -- usage events --> K{{Event stream}}
  K --> OBS[Cost · latency · quality dashboards]
  K --> EV[Evaluation store<br/>sampled traces + feedback]
